        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-316 (ensure controlled execution — Environmental Monitoring (PA-25.1).) | - operational: degradation-adjusted generation baseline with fault escalation when output drops &gt; 20% below expected
Owner: COO &amp; Construction (infrastructure) / Store Manager (daily)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
